# STRAT-003: Company OKRs Q3 2024

**MedSync Health**
**Document ID:** STRAT-003
**Version:** 1.0
**Date:** January 17, 2026 (Simulated Q3 2024 Planning)

---

## Executive Summary

This document outlines the company-wide Objectives and Key Results (OKRs) for MedSync Health for the third quarter of Fiscal Year 2024 (Q3 2024). These OKRs are designed to align the organization with the annual financial targets and strategic priorities set forth in the FY2024 Annual Plan (See STRAT-001) and are directly tied to the financial projections (See FIN-001 for financial targets).

The Q3 focus is on accelerating revenue growth, solidifying customer retention metrics, and scaling operational capacity in preparation for the Q4 push and the upcoming Series D follow-on.

---

## Q3 2024 Objectives and Key Results

### Objective 1: Accelerate Revenue Growth and Financial Health

**Goal:** Achieve the quarterly revenue target and maintain strong gross margins to demonstrate financial discipline and trajectory towards profitability.

| Key Result (KR) | Target | Stretch | Alignment |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| KR1: Achieve Q3 2024 Total Revenue | **AED 124,950,000** | AED 128,000,000 | FY2024 Revenue Projection (FIN-001) |
| KR2: Maintain Gross Margin at or above | **75.0%** | 76.0% | FY2024 Cost Structure (FIN-001) |
| KR3: Secure Q3 revenue from MedSync Connect (PROD-CONNECT) | **AED 47,040,000** | AED 48,500,000 | Product Revenue Breakdown (PROD-002) |
| KR4: Reduce Monthly Burn Rate to below | **AED 1,800,000** | AED 1,750,000 | FY2024 Financial Summary (FIN-001) |

*Note: All financial figures are in AED (United Arab Emirates Dirham) as per the master data model.*

### Objective 2: Drive Customer Success and Market Expansion

**Goal:** Solidify our market position by enhancing customer satisfaction and expanding our customer base, particularly in the high-value hospital segment.

| Key Result (KR) | Target | Stretch | Alignment |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| KR1: Increase Overall Company Net Promoter Score (NPS) to | **70** | 72 | Q4 2024 Target (SALES-003) |
| KR2: Achieve a Net Revenue Retention (NRR) of | **118%** | 120% | Annual Retention Goal (SALES-003) |
| KR3: Acquire a cumulative total of new customer organizations by the end of Q3 2024 | **670** | 700 | FY2024 New Customer Goal (SALES-001) |
| KR4: Maintain Logo Retention Rate at or above | **87%** | 88% | Annual Retention Goal (SALES-003) |

### Objective 3: Scale Operational Excellence and Team Capacity

**Goal:** Optimize internal processes and ensure the team is adequately staffed and engaged to support the company's rapid growth and product development roadmap.

| Key Result (KR) | Target | Stretch | Alignment |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| KR1: Achieve Q3 2024 Total Headcount of | **1,180** | 1,190 | FY2024 Headcount Plan (HR-001) |
| KR2: Reduce Voluntary Attrition Rate (T-12M) to below | **12.0%** | 11.5% | Employee Retention Goal (HR-002) |
| KR3: Complete the rollout of the new global HRIS system (Phase 2) with 100% employee data migration | **100%** | 100% | Operations Roadmap (OPS-001) |
| KR4: Maintain the Revenue per Employee (T-12M) at or above | **AED 404,250** | AED 410,000 | Efficiency Metric (OPS-002) |

